#: apps/marketing/content.py:49
msgid "How does an NFC card work?"
msgstr "NFC 卡片是如何工作的？"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:50
msgid ""
"Each card has a small chip programmed with the permanent link to your "
"digital card. When someone holds their phone near it, the phone opens your "
"card in its browser. Nothing is installed, and the chip needs no battery."
msgstr ""
"每张卡片内置一枚小芯片，写入了您电子名片的永久链接。对方把手机靠近卡片，手机就会在浏览器中打开您的名片。无需安装任何应用，芯片也不需要电池。"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:55
msgid "Does it work on both iPhone and Android?"
msgstr "iPhone 和安卓手机都能用吗？"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:56
msgid ""
"Yes. iPhone XS and newer read NFC tags automatically with the screen on. "
"Most Android phones read them when NFC is switched on in settings. If a "
"phone cannot tap, the QR code on the card opens the same page."
msgstr ""
"可以。iPhone XS 及更新机型在亮屏时会自动读取 NFC 标签；大多数安卓手机只需在设置中开启 "
"NFC。如果手机无法感应，卡片上的二维码会打开同一页面。"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:61
msgid "What happens when I change my details?"
msgstr "修改资料后会怎样？"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:62
msgid ""
"Your link, QR code and NFC card never change. They always open your latest "
"details, so there is nothing to reprint when you change job, number or "
"photo."
msgstr "您的链接、二维码和 NFC 卡片永远不会改变，打开的始终是您最新的资料。换工作、换号码或换照片时，无需重新印刷。"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:66
msgid "How does renewal work?"
msgstr "如何续订？"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:67
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Plans are yearly. We email you 30 days, 7 days and 1 day before your plan "
"ends. Renew early and the new year is added to the end of your current one, "
"so you lose nothing. If you miss the date your card keeps working for a "
"%(grace)d-day grace period."
msgstr ""
"套餐按年计算。在套餐到期前 30 天、7 天和 1 "
"天，我们会给您发送邮件。提前续订的话，新一年会接在当前期限之后，不会浪费任何时间。如果错过日期，您的名片仍会继续使用 %(grace)d 天宽限期。"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:79
msgid "What if my plan runs out?"
msgstr "套餐到期后会怎样？"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:80
msgid ""
"After the grace period your card shows a short 'card inactive' page instead "
"of your details. Renew at any time and the same link, QR code and NFC cards "
"work again straight away."
msgstr "宽限期结束后，您的名片会显示简短的“名片已停用”页面，而不是您的资料。随时续订，同一个链接、二维码和 NFC 卡片即可立即恢复使用。"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:84
msgid "I bought a ready-made card in a shop. How do I start?"
msgstr "我在门店买了一张预制名片，如何开始使用？"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:85
msgid ""
"Tap the card on your phone, or scan its QR code. Enter the PIN printed on "
"the back, add your details and create your account. Your first year is "
"already paid for, and the link on the card stays the same for good."
msgstr "用手机轻触名片或扫描二维码，输入背面印刷的 PIN 码，填写您的资料并创建账户。首年费用已包含在内，名片上的链接将永久不变。"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:90
msgid "How long does an NFC order take?"
msgstr "NFC 订单需要多久？"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:91
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You receive a first design proof within 3 working days of payment, and "
"%(rounds)d rounds of changes are free. Printing and encoding take up to 5 "
"working days after you approve, then delivery or pickup."
msgstr ""
"付款后 3 个工作日内您会收到第一版设计稿，其中 %(rounds)d 轮修改免费。确认设计后，印刷和写入芯片最长需 5 个工作日，之后配送或自取。"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:96
msgid "Do you deliver outside Ghana?"
msgstr "是否支持配送到加纳以外的地区？"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:97
msgid ""
"Yes. We deliver anywhere in Ghana by courier, you can pick up from our "
"office for free, and we ship abroad. For orders outside Ghana you pay the "
"international shipping and delivery fee for your region at checkout; any "
"import duties or taxes in your country are paid by the recipient. You see "
"the fee and the estimated time before you pay."
msgstr ""
"可以。我们通过快递配送至加纳各地，您也可以免费到我们办公室自取，并支持国际邮寄。加纳以外的订单，需在结账时支付所在地区的国际运输与配送费；您所在国家的进口关税或税费由收件人承担。付款前您会看到费用和预计送达时间。"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:103
msgid "Can I cancel an NFC order?"
msgstr "可以取消 NFC 订单吗？"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:104
msgid ""
"Before design work starts you get a full refund. After design starts and "
"before printing, 50% of the card price is refundable. Once printing starts "
"an order cannot be cancelled. A card with a faulty chip reported within 30 "
"days is replaced free."
msgstr ""
"设计工作开始前取消，可全额退款；设计开始后、印刷前取消，可退还卡片费用的 50%；印刷开始后，订单无法取消。芯片有故障的卡片，如在 30 "
"天内反馈，将免费更换。"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:109
msgid "Why are prices shown in other currencies?"
msgstr "为什么价格会以其他货币显示？"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:110
msgid ""
"Prices are shown in US dollars unless you choose another currency at the top"
" of the page. The figure is a guide for international customers, worked out "
"from today's exchange rate. You are always charged in Ghana cedis, and your "
"bank may use its own rate."
msgstr ""
"价格默认以美元显示，您也可以在页面顶部选择其他货币。该金额仅供海外客户参考，按当日汇率折算。实际始终以加纳塞地（GHS）收款，您的银行可能使用其自己的汇率。"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:115
msgid "Which payment methods can I use?"
msgstr "可以使用哪些付款方式？"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:116
msgid ""
"MTN MoMo, Telecel Cash and AirtelTigo Money, plus Visa and Mastercard cards."
" Payments go through Paystack's secure checkout; we never see your card or "
"wallet details."
msgstr ""
"支持 MTN MoMo、Telecel Cash 和 AirtelTigo Money，以及 Visa 和 Mastercard 银行卡。付款通过 "
"Paystack 的安全支付页面完成，我们不会看到您的银行卡或钱包信息。"

