#: templates/marketing/legal_terms.html:12
msgid ""
"Plans are paid yearly in Ghana cedis through Paystack. US dollar prices are "
"approximate and for guidance only."
msgstr "套餐按年以加纳塞地通过 Paystack 支付。美元价格仅为估算，仅供参考。"

#: templates/marketing/legal_terms.html:13
msgid "Your card becomes public only after Paystack confirms your payment."
msgstr "只有在 Paystack 确认您的付款后，您的名片才会公开。"

#: templates/marketing/legal_terms.html:15
#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you do not renew, your card keeps working for a "
"%(site_grace_period_days)s-day grace period, then shows a “card inactive” "
"page. Renew at any time to restore the same link, QR code and NFC cards."
msgstr ""
"如果您不续订，名片在 %(site_grace_period_days)s "
"天宽限期内仍可使用，之后会显示“名片已停用”页面。您可以随时续订，恢复原有的链接、二维码和 NFC 卡片。"

#: templates/marketing/legal_terms.html:16
msgid ""
"Price changes apply to new purchases and renewals only, never to time you "
"have already paid for."
msgstr "价格调整仅适用于新购买和续订，不影响您已付费的时间。"

#: templates/marketing/legal_terms.html:18
msgid "4. Your card link"
msgstr "4. 您的名片链接"

#: templates/marketing/legal_terms.html:19
msgid ""
"Your card link is permanent. You can change it only until an NFC card has "
"been ordered for it. Links are never given to another person, even after an "
"account is deleted."
