#: templates/marketing/legal_terms.html:20
msgid "5. Acceptable use"
msgstr "5. 可接受的使用方式"

#: templates/marketing/legal_terms.html:21
msgid ""
"You must not impersonate another person or business, use your card for "
"fraud, or publish offensive or unlawful content. We may suspend a card that "
"breaks these rules and will tell you why by email."
msgstr "您不得冒充他人或其他企业、利用名片实施欺诈，或发布冒犯性或违法内容。对于违反上述规则的名片，我们可能予以暂停，并通过邮件说明原因。"

#: templates/marketing/legal_terms.html:22
msgid "6. NFC orders"
msgstr "6. NFC 订单"

#: templates/marketing/legal_terms.html:23
#, python-format
msgid ""
