#: apps/marketing/content.py:72
msgid "Does my plan renew automatically?"
msgstr "我的套餐会自动续订吗？"

#: apps/marketing/content.py:73
msgid ""
"If you pay by card, yes. Your card is charged the same yearly price on the "
"day your plan ends, we email you about a week before and send a receipt "
"after, and you can turn it off at any time in your dashboard. Your plan then"
" stays active until the end of the year you paid for. Mobile Money payments "
"never renew by themselves; we send you reminders instead."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用银行卡付款，会自动续订：在套餐到期当天，我们会从您的银行卡扣除相同的年费，并在约一周前发邮件提醒您，扣款后发送收据。您可以随时在控制面板中关闭自动续订，关闭后套餐仍会持续到您已付费的年度结束。Mobile"
" Money 付款不会自动续订，我们会改为向您发送提醒。"

