#: templates/marketing/legal_terms.html:14
msgid ""
"A plan paid by Mobile Money is renewed by you. A plan paid by card renews "
"automatically each year: on the day it ends we charge the same card the plan"
" price shown at checkout, we email you about 7 days before and send a "
"receipt after, and you can turn automatic renewal off at any time in your "
"dashboard. Turning it off keeps your plan until the end of the year already "
"paid for. Renewing early adds a year to your current end date."
msgstr ""
"通过 Mobile Money "
"付款的套餐需由您自行续订。通过银行卡付款的套餐每年自动续订：套餐到期当天，我们会按结账时显示的套餐价格从同一张银行卡扣款，并在约 7 "
"天前发邮件提醒、扣款后发送收据，您可以随时在控制面板中关闭自动续订。关闭后，套餐会持续到已付费年度结束。提前续订会在当前到期日基础上增加一年。"

